@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

[*] --> CreateUser
[*] --> Login

state CreateUser
CreateUser : entry / start registration
CreateUser : do / verify information
CreateUser : exit / account created or invalid

state Login
Login : entry / start login
Login : do / validate credentials
Login : exit / logged in or invalid

CreateUser --> CheckLocation : [Registration Successful]
CreateUser --> InvalidRegistration : [Registration Failed]

Login --> CheckLocation : [Login Successful]
Login --> [*] : [Login Failed]

state CheckLocation
CheckLocation : entry / enter location details
CheckLocation : do / validate location
CheckLocation : exit / location validated or invalid

CheckLocation --> ChooseWeatherInfo : [Valid Location]
CheckLocation --> InvalidLocation : [Invalid Location]

state ChooseWeatherInfo
ChooseWeatherInfo : entry / select weather parameters
ChooseWeatherInfo : do / retrieve selected data
ChooseWeatherInfo : exit / display information

ChooseWeatherInfo --> DisplayWeatherInfo

state DisplayWeatherInfo
DisplayWeatherInfo : entry / show weather info
DisplayWeatherInfo : do / allow additional actions
DisplayWeatherInfo : exit /

DisplayWeatherInfo --> ViewAdditionalDetails : [View Additional Details]
DisplayWeatherInfo --> Logout : [Logout]

state ViewAdditionalDetails
ViewAdditionalDetails : entry / display details
ViewAdditionalDetails : do / allow navigation or logout
ViewAdditionalDetails : exit /

ViewAdditionalDetails --> DisplayWeatherInfo : [Back to Weather Info]
ViewAdditionalDetails --> Logout : [Logout]

state InvalidRegistration
InvalidRegistration : entry / registration failed
InvalidRegistration : do / notify user
InvalidRegistration : exit / end process

state InvalidLocation
InvalidLocation : entry / invalid location entered
InvalidLocation : do / notify user
InvalidLocation : exit / end process

state Logout
Logout : entry / initiate logout
Logout : do / close session
Logout : exit / end process

DisplayWeatherInfo --> [*] : [Logout]
ViewAdditionalDetails --> [*] : [Logout]
@enduml
